<v Ren Kozaki>[日语对话]

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:33.580
<v Miki Meek>The four of us are doing fine.
<v Miki Meek>我们四个都过得很好。

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:34.780
<v Ren Kozaki>[SPEAKING JAPANESE]
<v Ren Kozaki>[日语对话]

00:20:34.780 --> 00:20:36.180
<v Miki Meek>We're [JAPANESE].
<v Miki Meek>我们正在[日语]。

