<v Miki Meek>Dad, are you doing OK?
<v Miki Meek>爸爸，你还好吗？

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:51.800
<v Ren Kozaki>[SPEAKING JAPANESE]
<v Ren Kozaki>[日语对话]

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:56.990
<v Miki Meek>I do have one question I want to ask you.
<v Miki Meek>我有一个问题想问你。

