<v Ren Kozaki>[日语对话]

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:28.050
<v Miki Meek>Where are you now?
<v Miki Meek>你现在在哪里？

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:30.370
<v Ren Kozaki>[SPEAKING JAPANESE]
<v Ren Kozaki>[日语对话]

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:33.810
<v Miki Meek>They never found anything of you.
<v Miki Meek>他们什么都没找到你的。

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:36.570
<v Ren Kozaki>[SPEAKING JAPANESE]
<v Ren Kozaki>[日语对话]

