<v Miki Meek>Ren left the booth. In late February, he came back with his entire family-- his mom, younger brother, and sister. They all drove down to Otsuchi together. And when they got to the phone booth, at first they kind of awkwardly hung out in front of it. So to break the ice, Ren walks in and places the first call to their dad. He tells him--
<v Miki Meek>莲离开了电话亭。二月下旬，他带着全家回来——妈妈、弟弟和妹妹。他们一起开车来到大槌町。当他们到达电话亭时，起初他们尴尬地站在前面。为了打破僵局，莲走了进去，打出了给父亲的第一通电话。他告诉他——

00:22:09.410 --> 00:22:10.740
<v Ren Kozaki>[SPEAKING JAPANESE]
<v Ren Kozaki>[日语对话]

00:22:10.740 --> 00:22:12.820
<v Miki Meek>--I brought everyone with me today.
<v Miki Meek>——今天我把大家都带过来了。

00:22:12.820 --> 00:22:13.680
<v Ren Kozaki>[SPEAKING JAPANESE]
<v Ren Kozaki>[日语对话]

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:15.200
<v Miki Meek>Bye.
