<v Riku>[SPEAKING JAPANESE]
<v Riku>[日语对话]

00:22:19.280 --> 00:22:21.440
<v Miki Meek>That was so fast. Ren shoots back--
<v Miki Meek>这也太快了吧。莲反驳道——

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:23.110
<v Ren Kozaki>[SPEAKING JAPANESE]
<v Ren Kozaki>[日语对话]

00:22:23.110 --> 00:22:37.450
<v Miki Meek>--it was just a quick report to dad that I brought everyone with me today. Next up are Ren's little brother and sister, who are 12 and 14 years old. They go into the booth together, and the sister is talking and laughing nervously.
<v Miki Meek>——这只是快速汇报一下爸爸，我今天把大家都带来了。接下来是莲的弟弟和妹妹，他们分别是12岁和14岁。他们一起走进电话亭，妹妹紧张地边说边笑。

00:22:37.450 --> 00:22:41.030
<v Ren's Sister>[SPEAKING JAPANESE]
<v Ren's Sister>[日语对话]

00:22:41.030 --> 00:22:43.390
<v Miki Meek>What am I supposed to say? What should I tell them?
<v Miki Meek>我该说些什么？我该告诉他们什么？

