<v Ren's Sister>[哭泣声]

00:23:11.130 --> 00:23:17.220
<v Miki Meek>She asks her brother again, what should I talk to him about? Her little brother's name is Riku, and he tells her--
<v Miki Meek>她又问她哥哥，我该和他说些什么？她的小弟弟叫陆，他告诉她——

