<v Riku>[SPEAKING JAPANESE]
<v Riku>[日语对话]

00:23:18.820 --> 00:23:22.250
<v Miki Meek>Say what you wanted to tell him.
<v Miki Meek>说说你当时想告诉他的话吧。

