<v Jonathan Goldstein>Hi.
<v Jonathan Goldstein>嘿。

00:34:56.640 --> 00:35:03.330
<v Sheldon Goldstein>That was quite a shock getting your phone call. You said Jon, and I--
<v Sheldon Goldstein>接到你的电话真是太震惊了。你说乔恩，我——

