<v Jonathan Goldstein>Yeah.
<v Jonathan Goldstein>嗯。

00:37:02.410 --> 00:37:05.820
<v Sheldon Goldstein>Look, I don't want to be rude--
<v Sheldon Goldstein>看，我不想无礼——

00:37:05.820 --> 00:37:06.170
<v Jonathan Goldstein>Yeah, yeah.
<v Jonathan Goldstein>嗯，嗯。

00:37:06.170 --> 00:37:08.740
<v Sheldon Goldstein>--or anything, but I want to go have my lunch.
<v Sheldon Goldstein>——或者什么的，但我想要去吃午饭了。

00:37:08.740 --> 00:37:09.900
<v Jonathan Goldstein>Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah. That's fine.
<v Jonathan Goldstein>哦，是是是。那没关系。

