<v Sheldon Goldstein>Why not? We are brothers. I mean, we're not close or anything, but we're not going to have a chance to see each other much in the future.
<v Sheldon Goldstein>为什么不呢？我们是兄弟。我是说，我们不亲近什么的，但在未来我们不会有多少机会见到彼此了。

