<v Jonathan Goldstein>Yeah, I do.
<v Jonathan Goldstein>有的，我有。

00:37:50.290 --> 00:37:51.020
<v Buzz Goldstein>OK.
<v Buzz Goldstein>OK。

00:37:51.020 --> 00:38:12.080
<v Jonathan Goldstein>My dad and I meet up at the Fort Lauderdale Airport. I flew from New York and my dad from Montreal. My father's all dressed up, wearing a faux suede sports jacket that I've never seen him in. We grab our airport rental and prepare for the two-hour drive to Sheldon. In the 90-degree heat, it's immediately made clear that faux suede might not have been the best fashion choice.
<v Jonathan Goldstein>我和爸爸在劳德代尔堡机场见面。我从纽约飞来，爸爸从蒙特利尔飞来。我父亲打扮得整整齐齐，穿着一件我从未见过的仿麂皮运动夹克。我们租了车，准备去谢尔顿那里进行两个小时的车程。在90度的炎热天气里，显而易见，仿麂皮可能不是最好的时尚选择。

