<v Buzz Goldstein>[CAR DOOR SHUTTING]
<v Buzz Goldstein>[车门关上声]

00:38:16.730 --> 00:38:23.960
<v Jonathan Goldstein>On the road to Sheldon's, my father will experience a spectrum of feelings. As we first set out, there's excitement.
<v Jonathan Goldstein>在去往谢尔顿路上的过程中，父亲将经历一系列的情感波动。刚出发时，他很兴奋。

00:38:23.960 --> 00:38:30.880
<v Buzz Goldstein>My brother was funny in a lot of ways. I could laugh. We're going to have laughs with him. You know what I mean? He's a very funny man.
<v Buzz Goldstein>我弟弟在很多方面都很有趣。我能笑得出来。我们会和他一起欢笑。你知道我的意思吗？他是个很有趣的人。

