<v Buzz Goldstein>We invited him to your bar mitzvah. And he returned a very cold card. Sorry, we will not be attending. It was so mean, you know what I mean, even the writing.
<v Buzz Goldstein>我们邀请他参加你的成年礼。他回了一张非常冷淡的卡片。对不起，我们不会参加。真的很刻薄，你明白我的意思吗，即使是上面的字迹。

00:38:47.930 --> 00:38:50.430
<v Jonathan Goldstein>An hour in and how is Buzz feeling?
<v Jonathan Goldstein>一小时过去了，巴兹感觉如何？

