<v Ira Glass>离谢尔顿那里还有半小时。

00:38:56.420 --> 00:39:00.130
<v Buzz Goldstein>Little bit apprehensive now. [CHUCKLES]
<v Buzz Goldstein>现在有点不安了。[轻笑]

